{
  "id": "RAW_c7431ebd2b",
  "title": "拆解小红书存储底座 05｜RedTAO 2.0：万亿级图数据库的设计与实践",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&mid=2247497156&idx=1&sn=a65da187452ec808edf599fd8589362b",
  "date": "2026-11-12 17:59:00",
  "author": "小红书技术REDtech",
  "siteName": "小红书技术REDtech",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>REDtech</span> <span>2026-11-12 17:59</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_c92eec6.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>从点赞、关注、收藏到多跳图查询，看 RedTAO 如何通过分层架构，在万亿级数据规模下兼顾在线性能、业务扩展与异地多活。</p>\n  <div style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;text-decoration-thickness: auto;text-decoration-style: solid;font-size: 15px;padding: 0px 7px;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2777778\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013496\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_1abcc48.jpeg\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px 0px 30px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgba(160, 160, 160, 0.32);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"margin: 5px 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(160, 160, 160);line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">导读</span></strong></span></p>\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小红书的存储与数据库体系覆盖 MySQL、RedKV、Redis、ROS 等产品，DMS、RedDTS 等公共能力分别提供统一管控和数据传输支持。点赞、关注、收藏，构成了小红书社区最常见的关系；内容理解、搜索推荐等场景，则需要沿着这些关系发现更复杂的关联。随着业务发展，数据规模、查询复杂度和服务地域不断扩展，图数据库需要在承载海量数据的同时，兼顾高并发下的低延迟与多跳查询能力。</span></p>\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RedTAO 是小红书自研的分布式图数据库。它从支撑核心在线业务的一跳关系访问起步，逐步演进为支持多跳查询的图数据库。截至 2026 年 11 月，据生产环境监控数据统计，目前已部署</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">近百个集群</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，单集群最大承载</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">超过万亿行点边数据</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，在线查询规模</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">超过千万 QPS</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。作为「拆解小红书存储底座」系列的一篇，本文围绕</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">计算、缓存、存储三层分工</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，介绍 RedTAO 的架构判断、设计取舍与后续方向。</span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 20px 0px 5px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6231481\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013499\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_91414d3.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 40px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 20px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">背景</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 15px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">早期，RedTAO 主要服务于点赞、关注、收藏等场景。业务通常从一个用户或一篇笔记出发，读取直接关联的对象，访问路径明确，对响应速度和服务稳定性的要求很高。一跳关系访问由此成为系统建设的起点。当图能力进入一些更复杂的场景后，查询开始沿多层关系展开，还需要结合属性完成过滤、排序和聚合。如果这些过程都由业务逐次发起请求、拼接结果，接入成本和访问开销会随查询复杂度上升。与此同时，数据规模持续增长，跨区域业务也提出了就近访问和异地多活的要求。这使 RedTAO 的建设目标逐步扩展：既要延续核心在线服务的低延迟访问能力，也要把多跳查询沉淀为数据库的通用能力。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 25px 0px 10px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 36, 66);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"margin: 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">围绕这一目标，团队形成了三项架构选择：</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">计算、缓存与存储独立扩展；复杂查询由服务端统一规划；业务请求在所属单元内完成</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，跨单元更新通过数据同步传播。</span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">整体架构：用清晰的分层承接不同的增长</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图查询变复杂、热点流量增加、数据容量扩大，对应的资源需求并不相同。RedTAO 将系统划分为计算层、缓存层和存储层，分别围绕计算资源、内存容量和存储容量独立扩展。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">计算层负责理解和执行查询。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">无状态的 GraphServer 承接业务访问，在统一入口下提供一跳 API 和多跳 Gremlin 查询。</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">缓存层负责高频数据的快速访问。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">它面向关系集合、顶点属性和计数组织内存数据，承接在线读取。</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">存储层负责数据持久化。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">当前生产使用 MySQL，保存点、边及相关属性和计数，并为缓存回源提供数据。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">跨区域部署同样建立在明确的边界上。RedTAO 当前部署在多个异地单元，每个单元通过多个 region 提供异地多活能力，计算层和缓存层在各 region 独立部署。业务通过 SDK 访问所属单元内就近的服务，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在线请求不跨单元访问</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">；跨单元的数据更新通过主库之间的 RedDTS 双向同步传播，各 region 的缓存再通过变更回放更新，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">异地数据最终可见</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.7092593\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013498\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_509af2c.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图 1｜各单元业务在本单元内就近访问，主库之间通过 RedDTS 双向同步。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">分层也为异常处理提供了余地。在线读取优先使用缓存，未命中时回源；缓存访问失败或超时时，计算层可以通过</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">备用请求直接读取存储</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，降低缓存异常对读取可用性的影响。计算、缓存与存储各自承担明确职责，又通过回源、同步和降级路径相互协作。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4138889\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013497\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_4a4e2af.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图 2｜三层协作与备用读取：缓存访问失败或超时时，计算层直接访问存储层。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">03</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">计算层：让业务表达关系，让系统安排执行</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">计算层首先要把业务表达转化为可执行的查询计划。业界通常通过规则改写，或结合统计信息比较执行方案，减少不必要的访问。图查询的难点在于，关系每展开一层，都可能带来更多候选对象和中间结果；涉及路径时，还需要保存额外状态。因此，核心问题是</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在支持复杂查询的同时，控制数据访问与资源开销。</span></strong></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">面向在线业务，RedTAO 当前采用</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">基于规则的优化</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，将常见查询模式的优化经验沉淀为可解释、可扩展的规则，在规划开销和执行效率之间取得平衡。规划过程也会结合存储层的能力，尽量</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">让筛选和结果裁减靠近数据完成</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，降低传输与中间计算开销；其余部分由计算层接续处理，保证查询语义完整。计算与存储通过统一的能力描述协作，使查询优化能够适配不同后端，为后续演进留出空间。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013500\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_217d97e.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图 3｜查询编译、规则优化与双执行器：从 Gremlin 查询到执行结果。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 25px 0px 10px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 36, 66);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"margin: 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">执行阶段则通过</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">双执行器</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">匹配不同需求：普通遍历只维护必要的中间数据，涉及路径历史或循环时，再保留相应状态。</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">按查询需要选择执行方式</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，让常见查询保持较低开销，也为复杂查询保留表达能力。</span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">04</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">缓存层：围绕访问模式，降低整体查询代价</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">查询计划确定了要读取什么，缓存层则让高频数据以更低的代价到达计算层。业界常用 Redis、Memcached 等通用缓存承接热点读取，也有 Facebook TAO 这样围绕对象和关系组织数据的专用缓存服务。两种方式都在利用内存降低访问延迟，同时减轻持久化存储的压力。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">规模扩大后，缓存需要在</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">更新可见性、热点承载与回源压力</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">之间取得平衡。更新与失效机制决定业务何时看到新数据；热点复制、合并回源和负载隔离，则有助于缓解流量集中或大量未命中带来的冲击。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图查询还面临额外的通信成本：关系展开后，一批顶点可能散落在多个缓存节点上，缓存命中也无法消除多路 RPC 和等待汇总的开销。RedTAO 因此</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">按访问模式划分职责</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，由 Cache Server 服务关系集合，Vertex Server 服务顶点属性与计数。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">其中，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Vertex Server 用数据冗余减少 RPC 扇出。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">在限定的服务或数据集范围内，每份副本维护完整的顶点数据，使同一范围内的一批读取可以交给一个节点完成，多份副本再分担读流量。这样既减少网络往返和结果汇总，也降低等待多个节点带来的延迟波动。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 25px 0px 10px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 36, 66);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"margin: 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这种组织方式</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">以更多内存和副本维护成本，换取更少的跨节点访问</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，适合读密集、批量点读较多且数据规模可控的场景。缓存层的收益因此需要放在一次完整查询中衡量，同时关注延迟、吞吐与稳定性。</span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">05</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">存储层：在成熟底座上贴合图的访问模式</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">缓存降低了高频读取的成本，存储层则决定数据如何长期组织和维护。业界既有 Neo4j 这类面向图设计专用存储结构的路线，也有 JanusGraph、Facebook TAO 这类复用成熟存储系统的路线，选择取决于访问模式、扩展需求和运维条件。图数据库共同的难点是</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">兼顾读取效率、持续更新和规模扩展。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">相关关系集中存放有助于减少分散读取，但也需要避免热点集中；常用统计提前维护可以减少重复计算，却会增加更新和校正成本。索引、分区与预先维护查询结果，都是围绕这些问题作出的取舍。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RedTAO 当前以</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">MySQL 作为生产持久化底座</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，复用成熟的存储与复制能力，并围绕读密集场景调整数据组织：</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">让经常一起读取的关系靠近存放</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，减少分散读取和额外排序；</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">提前维护常用统计</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，让在线请求直接获得所需结果。</span></p>\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">多地部署下，RedTAO 让</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">各单元独立维护自身的统计贡献</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，再通过异步同步和本地汇总形成结果，偏差由校正机制收敛。这种分工减少了多个写入方共同修改同一总数的冲突，也延续了整体架构中本地访问、异地同步的边界。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5833333\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013503\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_427c512.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图 4｜关系就近组织、常用统计预维护与多地统计协作，共同支撑在线图访问。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 25px 0px 10px;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 100 100 0%;border-style: solid;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 3px;border-left: 3px solid rgb(255, 36, 66);height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px 14px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"margin: 0px;transform: translate3d(-5px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些选择以额外的数据组织、统计维护和校正成本，换取更低的在线读取开销。存储层由此把可靠保存数据与图访问优化结合起来，为上层查询和缓存提供稳定支撑。</span></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">06</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;box-sizing: border-box;\">展望未来</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">三层分工为持续演进提供了基础：查询表达、数据访问和持久化可以沿各自的方向优化，再通过明确的接口协同。随着业务从直接关系访问走向更复杂的关联查询，RedTAO 的下一阶段仍将围绕查询能力、资源效率与可靠性展开。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">接下来，RedTAO 将沿三个方向继续演进。</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">计算层</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">探索面向大规模生产数据的复杂图计算；</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">缓存层</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">继续优化内存组织、批量访问和更新传播，提升低延迟访问能力与稳定性；</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">存储层</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">考虑从 MySQL 演进到 RedDB，针对图的数据模式进行深度定制优化，以降低成本，并将图能力融入多模数据库的统一底座。这些方向仍属于</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">后续演进规划</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，将在现有分层基础上逐步推进。</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2981481\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;max-width:100%;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;\" data-backw=\"0\" data-backh=\"0\" data-imgfileid=\"100013502\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_ad612ec.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 1.8;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图 5｜当前生产架构与后续方向分别列示。</span></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">从一跳关系访问走向多场景图查询，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">RedTAO 的演进始终由业务变化推动。</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">每一层都在查询能力、资源成本和服务稳定性之间作出取舍，清晰的分工则让这些选择能够协同落地，并随业务发展持续调整。我们期待与行业伙伴交流图数据库的设计与实践，共同探索更稳定高效、更贴近业务的图数据基础设施。</span></p>\n    <div style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;text-decoration-thickness: auto;text-decoration-style: solid;font-size: 15px;padding: 0px 7px;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"8 4 []\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;box-sizing: border-box;\">07</span></strong></p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;box-sizing: border-box;\">作者简介</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">秋山，小红书存储与数据库团队工程师，负责 RedTAO 图数据库的研发与建设。</span></p>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">部门介绍：</span></span></p>\n      <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">存储&amp;数据库部，为小红书全业务场景打造行业领先的高可用、高可靠、高性能、低成本的存储和数据库类产品技术服务。团队致力于用精英化的组织和行业领先的技术理念，先于业务布局和行动，为公司业务的快速发展提供充足“弹药”，同时也让小红书存储和数据库成为行业该领域的标杆。</span></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 50px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: auto;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(255, 36, 66);min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;height: auto;padding: 0px 6px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">08</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"margin: 10px 0px 20px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: justify;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">招聘</span></strong></p>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\">分布式数据库研发工程师/专家-存储&amp;数据库：</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"weapp_text_link js_weapp_entry\" style=\"\" data-unique-id=\"mwd7fta5-27ddq1\" data-miniprogram-type=\"text\" data-miniprogram-appid=\"wx6e18c5c45387efa2\" data-miniprogram-path=\"pages/detail/detail?id=13937&amp;sourceChannel=website\" data-miniprogram-nickname=\"小红书招聘\" data-miniprogram-servicetype=\"0\" data-miniprogram-applink=\"#小程序://小红书招聘/XRMyj6ju8IwBlfC\">小红书招聘</a></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">图/表/向量/多模数据库等方向</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2777778\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 753px;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100013501\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261112142507_b650064.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">精彩回顾：</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&amp;mid=2247496855&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=f426a8f58708ca0fbef34b7e3308e468&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"拆解小红书存储底座 00｜从孤岛走向融合：小红书存储与数据库架构进化\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">拆解小红书存储底座 00｜从孤岛走向融合：小红书存储与数据库架构进化</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&amp;mid=2247496885&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fcecfc62b3f876191ebaf931ace2ecc4&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"拆解小红书存储底座 01｜多源数据传输总线 RedDTS 2.0\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">拆解小红书存储底座 01｜多源数据传输总线 RedDTS 2.0</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&amp;mid=2247496958&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=bafda0c7a7030b5542ae6c54f26876d5&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"拆解小红书存储底座 02｜让 AI 成为团队的一员：存储数据库助理实践\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">拆解小红书存储底座 02｜让 AI 成为团队的一员：存储数据库助理实践</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&amp;mid=2247496995&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4f8f5120b9fff8d77f0c8c9d9c590fee&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"拆解小红书存储底座 03｜从存得下到读得快：小红书自研对象存储实践\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">拆解小红书存储底座 03｜从存得下到读得快：小红书自研对象存储实践</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 15px;text-align: justify;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);text-autospace: normal;letter-spacing: 2px;line-height: 2;word-break: break-all;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4OTc2MzczNg==&amp;mid=2247497095&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=c498a5620224ad5b758fbcd3b4276e22&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"拆解小红书存储底座 04｜从对象到文件：RedStore SSD 引擎与 RedFS 的设计与实践\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">拆解小红书存储底座 04｜从对象到文件：RedStore SSD 引擎与 RedFS 的设计与实践</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文详解了小红书自研的分布式图数据库 RedTAO 2.0 的三层架构设计，包括计算、缓存、存储层的职责划分及实现方案，以及如何在万亿级数据规模下支持低延迟的在线查询和跨区域多活。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文详解了小红书自研的分布式图数据库 RedTAO 2.0 的三层架构设计，包括计算、缓存、存储层的职责划分及实现方案，以及如何在万亿级数据规模下支持低延迟的在线查询和跨区域多活。",
  "summary": "本文聚焦小红书自研分布式图数据库 RedTAO 2.0 的设计与实践。文章首先阐述了图数据库在点赞、关注、收藏等场景下的演进需求，随后介绍了 RedTAO 采用的三层分工架构：计算层通过无状态的 GraphServer 提供一跳 API 和多跳 Gremlin 查询，缓存层由 Cache Server 和 Vertex Server 负责关系集合、顶点属性和计数的高频数据快速访问，存储层采用 MySQL 作为持久化底座，围绕读密集场景调整数据组织方式。文章进一步详细描述了查询优化策略、缓存组织方式、存储数据布局以及跨区域部署下的同步机制。最后，作者展望了 RedTAO 的未来发展方向，包括面向大规模数据的复杂图计算、内存组织优化以及从 MySQL 演进到 RedDB 的计划。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "三层分工架构设计",
      "explanation": "RedTAO 将系统划分为计算层、缓存层和存储层，分别围绕计算资源、内存容量和存储容量独立扩展，支持在线性能、业务扩展与异地多活的平衡。"
    },
    {
      "point": "计算层的查询优化策略",
      "explanation": "采用基于规则的优化，将常见查询模式的优化经验沉淀为可解释、可扩展的规则，同时结合存储层能力，尽量让筛选和结果裁减靠近数据完成，降低传输与中间计算开销。"
    },
    {
      "point": "缓存层的组织方式",
      "explanation": "按访问模式划分职责，Cache Server 服务关系集合，Vertex Server 服务顶点属性与计数；Vertex Server 通过数据冗余减少 RPC 扇出，适合读密集、批量点读较多且数据规模可控的场景。"
    },
    {
      "point": "存储层的数据组织与同步机制",
      "explanation": "以 MySQL 作为持久化底座，让经常一起读取的关系靠近存放，提前维护常用统计；跨区域部署下，各单元独立维护自身的统计贡献，再通过异步同步和本地汇总形成结果。"
    },
    {
      "point": "未来演进方向规划",
      "explanation": "RedTAO 将沿着复杂图计算、内存组织优化和从 MySQL 演进到 RedDB 三个方向继续演进，以降低成本并将图能力融入多模数据库的统一底座。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "RedTAO 是小红书自研的分布式图数据库。它从支撑核心在线业务的一跳关系访问起步，逐步演进为支持多跳查询的图数据库。",
    "截至 2026 年 11 月，目前已部署近百个集群，单集群最大承载超过万亿行点边数据，在线查询规模超过千万 QPS。",
    "RedTAO 将系统划分为计算层、缓存层和存储层，分别围绕计算资源、内存容量和存储容量独立扩展。",
    "计算层首先要把业务表达转化为可执行的查询计划。业界通常通过规则改写，或结合统计信息比较执行方案，减少不必要的访问。",
    "RedTAO 当前以 MySQL 作为生产持久化底座，复用成熟的存储与复制能力，并围绕读密集场景调整数据组织。"
  ],
